    <title>050 【机秘碎念】不装了，终于开始挑剔我爸做的菜了。人生就是越早搞砸越好啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6897672f20a2906a4db74bf8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6897672f20a2906a4db74bf8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 Aug 2025 15:21:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>对于总是活在失败焦虑里的人来说，失败脱敏一定要搞起来。</span><br><span></span><br><span>如果</span><a href="https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%23%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E5%B7%A8%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%8E%E6%84%BF%E8%BF%9D%23" data-url="https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%23%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E5%B7%A8%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%8E%E6%84%BF%E8%BF%9D%23"><span>人生是一场巨大的事与愿违</span></a><span>，那就意味着，不管搞砸什么都不会更糟了，那就什么都可以做。</span><br><span></span><br><span>🪄今天的魔法打败魔法，做你的搞砸搭子，聊一聊如何大胆的闯祸！晚安咯，陌生人。</span></p>]]></description>
